                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.11/1107: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Canton</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jenkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-04-25T11:00:00-05:00">April 25, 1930—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your April 24, noon, last paragraph. Neither Department nor Catholic authorities
                    have information of later date.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
